part vertical guide
  needs  height

  axis
    is a  point
    at    0 cm up

  near wall
    is a  box 1 by 13.2 cm by height
    on    floor, 6.1 cm behind axis

  far wall
    is a  box 1 by 13.2 cm by height
    on    floor, 6.1 cm beyond axis

  left wall
    is a  box 11.2 by 1 cm by height
    on    floor, 6.1 cm left of axis

  right wall
    is a  box 11.2 by 1 cm by height
    on    floor, 6.1 cm right of axis
